			"notes": "## ⚠️ Upgrading from 3.x (3.0.0 or older)\n  The old config files (`sleepingserverstoppermod-common.toml` / `.cfg`) are **no longer read**. On first launch the mod creates a new file, `config/sleepingserverstoppermod.properties`, with the defaults. Copy your old values into it:\n\n  ```properties\n  # How many minutes the server must be empty before it shuts down. (Minimum is 1 minute!)\n  shutdownTimeInMinutes=2\n  # Should the shutdown countdown start as soon as the server launches?\n  shutdownOnLaunch=true\n  ```\n\n  If you skip this, your server will use the defaults (2 minutes, countdown on launch).\n\n  ## What's new\n  - **Each jar now covers a range of Minecraft versions.** 12 jars replace the old one-jar-per-version setup. For example, one Fabric jar covers 1.16.4 – 1.21.11 and one NeoForge jar covers 1.20.6 – 26.x.\n  - **New on Fabric:** 1.17.x, and every 1.20.x and 1.21.x release.\n  - **New on Forge:** 1.17.1, 1.20.2 – 1.20.4 and 1.20.6 – 1.21.11.\n  - **New on NeoForge:** 1.20.1 – 1.20.4 and 1.20.6.\n  - Jar names now show the range they cover, e.g. `sleepingserverstoppermod-fabric-4.1.0+1.16.4-1.21.11.jar`.\n\n  ## Which file do I need?\n  | Loader | Minecraft | File |\n  | :-- | :-- | :-- |\n  | Fabric | 26.1 – 26.x | `sleepingserverstoppermod-fabric-4.1.0+26.x.jar` |\n  | Fabric | 1.16.4 – 1.21.11 | `sleepingserverstoppermod-fabric-4.1.0+1.16.4-1.21.11.jar` |\n  | NeoForge | 1.20.6 – 26.x | `sleepingserverstoppermod-neoforge-4.1.0+1.20.6-26.x.jar` |\n  | NeoForge | 1.20.2 – 1.20.4 | `sleepingserverstoppermod-neoforge-4.1.0+1.20.2-1.20.4.jar` |\n  | NeoForge | 1.20.1 | `sleepingserverstoppermod-forge-4.1.0+1.18.2-1.20.1.jar` (NeoForge 1.20.1 is a Forge fork) |\n  | Forge | 1.21.6 – 1.21.11 | `sleepingserverstoppermod-forge-4.1.0+1.21.6-1.21.11.jar` |\n  | Forge | 1.20.6 – 1.21.5 | `sleepingserverstoppermod-forge-4.1.0+1.20.6-1.21.5.jar` |\n  | Forge | 1.20.2 – 1.20.4 | `sleepingserverstoppermod-forge-4.1.0+1.20.2-1.20.4.jar` |\n  | Forge | 1.18.2 – 1.20.1 | `sleepingserverstoppermod-forge-4.1.0+1.18.2-1.20.1.jar` |\n  | Forge | 1.17.1 | `sleepingserverstoppermod-forge-4.1.0+1.17.1.jar` |\n  | Forge | 1.16.5 | `sleepingserverstoppermod-forge-4.1.0+1.16.5.jar` |\n  | Forge | 1.12.2 | `sleepingserverstoppermod-forge-4.1.0+1.12.2.jar` |\n  | Forge | 1.7.10 | `sleepingserverstoppermod-forge-4.1.0+1.7.10.jar` |\n\n  Only the server needs the mod. Fabric also needs [Fabric API](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api).\n\n  **Full changelog:** https://github.com/MadaHaz/SleepingServerStopper/compare/v4.0.0...v4.1.0"
